  "ruleText": "Rev 2501.10 defining “holiday” was repealed by Document #13724. The prior filings affecting the rule Rev 2501.10 included the following documents:\n\n#6639, eff 11-27-97, EXPIRED 11-27-05\n\n#8495, eff 11-30-05 (formerly Rev 2501.08)\n\n#10484, eff 12-5-13 (from Rev 2501.09)\n\nDocument #13724 eliminated the reserved numbers, and thereby the source notes, for the following rules:",
